{"id": "1538189816519467078", "channel_id": "1356210800091467928", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Until you have a full 5 teams that would be my advice, yes.\nThen it's a choice between pulling for the first copy of all standard wheels you will use or wait until you got duplicates for your chosen awakeners first", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T14:17:10.443000+00:00", "thread_id": "1356210800091467928", "thread_title": "【Newcomer Help】Forum Introduction", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956"}
{"id": "1538190192454672565", "channel_id": "1356210800091467928", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "As for which realm to pull into, I'd say all of them.\nChaos and Æquor are usually the most newcommer-friendly but these alone won't cover all your needs.", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T14:18:40.073000+00:00", "thread_id": "1356210800091467928", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-15T14:48:58.959000+00:00", "thread_title": "【Newcomer Help】Forum Introduction", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956"}
